    {
      "id": 6109,
      "name": "kirioni",
      "username": "kirioni",
      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/k/5f9b8f/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2012-07-26T16:06:30.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>So, I am very excited that soon we will be welcoming some new Heroes and facing new villians in new locals…</p>\n<p>So I had the idea to throw a party to celebrate. Here are my ideas, would love to here what other ideas people may have to mark this momentous occasions!</p>\n<p>Environment themed tables where people play through a set up scenario with a little story to set it up, and lower stakes akin to a demo game (less HP for Villain) for a quicker game (30 minutes) and people meeting all the characters as they rotate through the tables.</p>\n<p>Custom invitations with a costume element thrown in with perhaps some sentinels related door prize, or some variation on the Sentinels Points idea from Gen Con with different prizes…</p>\n<p>Love to hear other’s ideas or how they are marking the great occasion!</p>",
      "post_number": 1,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:35:57.152Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
