      "raw": "I love this idea! \n\nI especially like using the environments for table themes (Atlantis, Wagner Mars Base, and Insula Primalis lend themselves really well to this idea since under the sea, space, and dinosaur decorations are readily available, Tomb of Anubis would probably be the next easiest to decorate for... Rook City and Realm of Discord could be lots of fun or super frustrating though). \n\nDepending on your friends, you could get a group to cosplay specific characters (and then bring your costumes to GenCon's contest too!) and/or you could just ask people to come as a hero of their own devising. \n\nI'm trying to think of SotM food ideas... you could make Smoke Bomb drinks (with dry ice), or make deviled eggs with a little creative use of red/orange food die to make Citizens of the Sun deviled eggs (die the egg white in the striped red and orange of their logo), ... themed food ideas are hard though....",
