      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/r/ecae2f/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2012-07-28T11:55:53.000Z",
      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"&quot;&quot;flamethrower49&quot;&quot;\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n \"\"flamethrower49\"\":</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>If I weren’t getting married and going on my honeymoon right around the time this would be coming out, I would totally do these.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>I think that’s a valid excuse. Congratulations!</p>\n<p>I know it’s a game that requires a reasonable amount of concentration, but for those for whom it’d be legal - how about a Sentinels drinking game? Two fingers every time you’re forced to destroy equipment? Finish your drink when Baron Blade / Citizen Dawn flips? (Probably best not to do that with Omnitron, ;D)</p>",
