      "raw": "My fiancee went nuts with this idea.  Here are the ideas we had that had some merit.\n\nHaka's Vitality Surge - Kiwi Jello Shots\nBunker's Baked Battery - Baked Potatoes, wrapped in foil, with a spread of options for \"Upgrading\"\nTempest - Sushi!     (I noted that he may not appreciate that, because it might talk to him.  She didn't care.)\nRa's Fireballs - Strawberries covered in sour cream and brown sugar.  (I didn't know it was a thing, but it's apparently very good.)\nFanatic's Angel Food Cake\nAbsolute Zero's Thermal Shockwave: Baked Alaska or Bananas Flambe, or any flaming dessert. \n\nThese other ideas aren't as fleshed out.\n\nTachyon - Fast food.  (Ha, ha.)  Some sort of appetizer.  Sliders or pizza rolls might be good.\nLegacy - Something All-American is as far as she got.  Apple pie is a strong contender.\nWraith - Something rich.  Maybe involves chocolate.\nExpatriette - She seems like a steak girl.\nMister Fixer - Dumplings.\nNightmist - Fried Calamari?\nUnity - Gingerbread cookies.\n\nNo ideas yet Argent Adept or Visionary.\n\nWe won't be having these at the wedding.  But we are beginning to give very strong consideration to a themed party sometime after.",
