      "created_at": "2012-07-30T13:56:19.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Thanks for the thoughts, Mid-September would probably be enough time to plan and get a good crowd together, who knows I might hold it on the old wedding anniversary weekend <img src=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/slight_smile.png?v=9\" title=\":slight_smile:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":slight_smile:\"> Seems a fitting celebration of a dynamic duo!</p>\n<p>I am taking lots of notes and might even need some recipes from you all. Great ideas!</p>",
